{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L1RoZSUyMFRhbGUlMjBPZiUyMFRleGFzJTIwUG9vbCUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"The Tale Of Texas Pool","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bHbwdHdZO68IvB1K5bkrsqBO1A6.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aiwDquUs0ws3IBKU74sH8cufJc0.jpg","description":"*The Tale of Texas Pool* is a captivating documentary that delves into the rich history of billiards in Texas, uncovering its deep ties to the state's culture and identity. The film explores the close connection between the game and gambling, focusing on the hustlers who use inventive and high-stakes bets to lure in challengers. Through colorful anecdotes of bizarre wagers—like roller-skate pool matches and golf balls hurled over vast distances—the documentary showcases the sport's unpredictable and fiercely competitive spirit. More than just a look at a game, *The Tale of Texas Pool* paints a vivid portrait of the people and places that have shaped Texas culture. By weaving together personal stories with historical insights, it offers a compelling exploration of how billiards became a cornerstone of the state's identity, while celebrating the resilience, character, and passion that define both the sport and its players.\n\nRated NR · Released 25 Dec 2024 · United States of America · Language: English · 112 min\nStudio: Great Slate Production Group\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Documentary","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"9.5","runtime":"112 min","cast":["Jeremy Jones","Nick Varner","Buddy Hall","Sky Woodward","James Davis, Sr.","James Davis, Jr.","Gilbert Martinez, Jr.","Belinda Calhoun"],"director":["Kevin Welling"],"released":"2024-12-25T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The story of Texas as told by pool hustlers and players.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Kevin Welling","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rofgTEP1mD6xlBxCDnXVYG5x5Bc.jpg"},{"nam